    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠣᠲᠠᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>dutaqdaγulqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дутагдуулах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DUTAΓDAΓUL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of dutaγda-] To cause a lack or shortage, cause to be insufficient; to omit.</definition>
      <page>277</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠲᠠᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠪᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei ber</transcript>
          <definition> Without omission, in regular sequence.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠰᠢᠶᠠᠷᠠᠨ ᠳᠣᠲᠠᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>tasijaran --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To commit an oversight, make an error.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Chinese</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠤᠲᠠᠭᠳᠠᠭᠤᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>дутагдуулах</cyrillic>
      <definition>〔动〕дутагдах 的使动态；使缺乏，使缺少，使不足：дутагдуулсан зүйлийг төлж гүйцээх 补偿短缺的东西.</definition>
      <page>445</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
